“Builder is a creational design pattern used to construct complex objects step by step.
It separates the construction process from the final object, which is especially useful
when an object has many optional parameters or different valid configurations.
It improves readability and avoids telescoping constructors.”

“Builder is a creational pattern that separates complex object construction from its representation,
allowing us to construct objects step by step, particularly when there are many optional parameters
or configurations.”